    {
      "source": "Calls <a href=\"../../util/ResourceUtils.html#useCachesIfNecessary(java.net.URLConnection)\"><code>ResourceUtils.useCachesIfNecessary(URLConnection)</code></a> and\ndelegates to <a href=\"#customizeConnection(java.net.HttpURLConnection)\"><code>customizeConnection(HttpURLConnection)</code></a> if possible.\nCan be overridden in subclasses.",
      "translation": "调用<a href=\"../../util/ResourceUtils.html#useCachesIfNecessary(java.net.URLConnection)\"><code>ResourceUtils.useCachesIfNecessary(URLConnection)</code></a>，并在可能的情况下委托给<a href=\"#customizeConnection(java.net.HttpURLConnection)\"><code>customizeConnection(HttpURLConnection)</code></a>。可在子类中重写此方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "For a custom subclass of <code>InputStreamResource</code>, we strongly\nrecommend overriding this method with a more optimal implementation, for example,\nchecking File length, or possibly simply returning -1 if the stream can\nonly be read once.",
      "translation": "对于 `<code>InputStreamResource`</code> 的自定义子类，我们强烈建议通过更优化的实现来重写此方法，例如检查文件长度，或者如果流只能读取一次则直接返回 -1。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Detects the \"file\" protocol as well as the JBoss \"vfs\" protocol in URLs,\nresolving file system references accordingly.",
      "translation": "检测 URL 中的\"file\"协议以及 JBoss\"vfs\"协议，并相应解析文件系统引用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This will cover both directories and content resources.",
      "translation": "这将同时涵盖目录和内容资源。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Can be overridden in subclasses for configuring request headers and timeouts.",
      "translation": "可在子类中重写以配置请求头和时间间隔。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation always returns <code>true</code> for a resource\nthat <a href=\"AbstractResource.html#exists()\"><code>exists</code></a> (revised as of 5.1).",
