    {
      "source": "Determine whether the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/net/URI.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.net\"><code>URI</code></a> represents a file in a file system.",
      "translation": "确定给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/net/URI.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.net\"><code>URI</code></a> 是否表示文件系统中的文件。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation always returns <code>false</code>.",
      "translation": "此实现始终返回<code>false</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation returns a File reference for the underlying class path\nresource, provided that it refers to a file in the file system.",
      "translation": "此实现返回底层类路径资源的 File 引用，前提是该资源指向文件系统中的文件。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation returns a File reference for the given URI-identified\nresource, provided that it refers to a file in the file system.",
      "translation": "此实现返回给定 URI 标识资源的 File 引用，前提是该资源指向文件系统中的文件。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation determines the underlying File\n(or jar file, in case of a resource in a jar/zip).",
      "translation": "此实现确定底层的文件（如果是 jar 中的资源，则为 jar 文件或 zip 文件）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation checks the timestamp of the underlying File,\nif available.",
      "translation": "此实现会检查底层文件的戳记（如果可用）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation returns a FileChannel for the given URI-identified\nresource, provided that it refers to a file in the file system.",
      "translation": "此实现返回给定 URI 标识资源的 FileChannel，前提是该资源指向文件系统中的文件。",
      "count": 2
